    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah. but even the \"small ways\" feel like just more things to do. like i'm just performing \"self-care\" to make sure i can be a better worker tomorrow. it feels like there is no actual escape. everything is just part of the system, even the stuff that's supposed to make me feel human. it's exhausting.",
