    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the effort\"... that sounds almost peaceful. but what does that even mean? like, how do you actually stop? it feels like if i stop, i'll just be crushed by everything i'm leaving behind. is it even possible to really just walk away from it all?",
